answer.worked:
$$\begin{align*}
P(1\le X\le3)&=\int_1^3\frac{4x^3}{81}\,dx\\
P(1\le X\le3)&=\left[\frac{x^4}{81}\right]_1^3\\
P(1\le X\le3)&=\frac{81-1}{81}\\
P(1\le X\le3)&=\frac{80}{81}
\end{align*}$$

